{"created": "2026-07-05T09:08:26.723964+00:00", "modified": "2026-08-04T09:53:12.886161+00:00", "id": 21200586, "conceptrecid": "21200585", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21200586", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.21200585", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21200586", "metadata": {"title": "GSE280465", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21200586", "publication_date": "2026-07-05", "description": "<p>This dataset contains a processed DNA methylation resource derived from GEO Series GSE280465 through a Bioconductor ExperimentHub data package.</p>\n<p>The resource is stored as a RangedSummarizedExperiment object generated from a minfi GenomicRatioSet. It contains methylation beta values, M values, copy number estimates, hg38 genomic ranges, sample-level phenotype metadata, and provenance metadata.</p>\n<p>The resource represents the adult GSE280465 EPICv2 dataset: 163 samples from 47 individuals across buccal, saliva, dried blood spot, and peripheral blood mononuclear cell tissues. The data were profiled using GPL33022, Illumina Infinium MethylationEPIC version 2.</p>\n<p>The source study is \"Cross-Tissue Comparison of Epigenetic Aging Clocks in Humans\", Aging Cell, 2025, DOI: 10.1111/acel.14451. The original public data are available from GEO accession GSE280465.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Ruiz Pinto, Paul", "affiliation": "Queensland University of Technology", "orcid": "0009-0007-6714-3566"}], "keywords": ["Bioconductor", "ExperimentHub", "SummarizedExperiment", "RangedSummarizedExperiment", "DNA methylation", "GSE280465", "GPL33022", "EPICv2", "Illumina Infinium MethylationEPIC version 2", "epigenetic clocks", "epigenetic aging", "aging", "cross-tissue", "buccal", "saliva", "dried blood spot", "PBMC", "Homo sapiens"], "version": "1.0.0", "references": ["Apsley, A. T., Ye, Q., Caspi, A., Chiaro, C., Etzel, L., Hastings, W. J., Heim, C. M., Kozlosky, J., Noll, J. G., Schreier, H. M. C., Shenk, C. E., Sugden, K., & Shalev, I. (2025). Cross-tissue comparison of epigenetic aging clocks in humans. Aging cell, 24(4), e14451. https://doi.org/10.1111/acel.14451"], "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/paulYRP/GSE280465", "code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "r", "title": {"en": "R"}}], "code:developmentStatus": {"id": "active", "title": {"en": "Active"}}}, "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "21200585"}}]}}, "title": "GSE280465", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21200586", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21200586", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21200586?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21200586", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21200586", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21200586", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21200586/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21200585", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21200585", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21200585", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21200585", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21200586/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21200586/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21200586/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21200586/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21200586/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21200586/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21200586/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21200586/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21200586/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21200586/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21200586/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo